          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Nov 16 2021 20:06:59 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">LIFENET Care<br>\n </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Stryker's next-generation patient data communication platform.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Get a more unified view of your patient's journey on a modern, clean interface. LIFENET Care helps make it easier to consolidate patient data, organize your workflow and connect care teams.</span></p>\n",
